<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-FRENCHMAN ROUS WINS 18TH STAGE OF TOUR DE FRANCE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-FRENCHMAN ROUS WINS 18TH STAGE OF TOUR DE FRANCE.</headline>
<dateline>MONTBELIARD, France 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Didier Rous of France won the 18th stage of the Tour de France over 175.5 kms from Colmar on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Jan Ullrich of Germany retained the overall lead.</p>
</text>
